<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-11-22T00:32:07.809Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 00:32:07 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraqi security forces have moved into the Iran-backed militia strongholds of Jurf al-Sakhar and Jurf al-Nasr, deploying new security posts to protect oil pipelines and checkpoints after a deal with the militia. The Prime Minister ordered a probe into a deadly gas pipeline blast in Basra and an oil smuggling case in Najaf, issuing an arrest warrant for a provincial council member. Iraqi forces also entered a stronghold of a powerful Iran-backed militia and took over checkpoints in a Kataib Hezbollah area. The UCDP recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxOdGtDVUVuSFA3aldyV3lnZHhnTlJoYm9pa05NNGgyLU85amVrVmRQTU1SZEJjcUJCVFljM0RzOHc5aVhmOTR2c285RnRpRTI1MWpTOW52TG9tRWkySUNtbFQ2RDcxYnAxcG1Kc3BlUmtPekxkcGZyMk5BdTZNeWhYX0NkNTZoWVUzMU02LVlvUVNnVXJCUndZZzRIbEw?oc=5&quot;&gt;CNN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxOSmhZODNjd292clh2TlJBYWJNV0NuQV93UWxVTmxiMmNJaHJnNHI5WFF2bVJwOHgwcmdRS21DU3lYbGQ5aXdCVW1HbjNoaVRnSlFPRThCOFdsbTd3Y0hDUlJPci04QzdVM0d0SDhqMzVEU0VQYTUzWFNSd29FeklxbTlKWk8yQnZCV3ktZlZaOFpncHhzU3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiakFVX3lxTFBxUTBzbnpycXFNQWVVMFZjV1V6WTVqTGZWWnJPT0pZeEFjZUNBY25uMi1TdGQzc3I1LXh1cjZBSmM4RS1acHhTNm0zM1V4NnZaMVZDN3FqYXZPY1UzbzlVZklkV1Y3R1Jxb2c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Rudaw&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxPM0JHNmZNN25tSUQySHNEVnhCOEh6TjRHTkRNY0s2b25ZN1FDbmpMMUdoRFExNkplQ2VjNEpKUG5QQmhHcUZxSDVHZWQ2bzRTazZmWjlzUnNzdDZuMTMzMnhPT3dEWkd0